<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RMP says Randgold deal to be sealed in July.</title>
<headline>RMP says Randgold deal to be sealed in July.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's RMP Properties Ltd said in Tuesday that negotiations to sell its land clearing and gold-recovery operations to Randgold and Exploration Company Ltd were expected to be sealed during July.</p>
<p>In the same announcement Barprop Ltd said that plans to rationalise it and RMP's property divisions had been approved by the South African Revenue Service and details would be announced in August.</p>
<p>Both firms urged shareholders to continue to exercise caution when dealing in their shares until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
